### Works in IntelliJ HTTP Client and the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@admin = PASTE_YOUR_ADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_API_KEY
@key = PASTE_A_CLIENT_KEY_CREATED_BELOW
@job = PASTE_A_JOB_ID

### Health (public)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/health

### Create a client key (admin only). The secret is in "api_key" and is shown once.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "my-android-backend", "rate_limit_per_minute": 30, "daily_quota": 200, "max_concurrent_jobs": 2 }

### List keys / revoke a key
GET {{host}}/api/v1/admin/api-keys
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/admin/api-keys/PASTE_KEY_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Models
GET {{host}}/api/v1/models
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/v1/models/myimageai-v1
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Submit (async): returns 202 and a job id
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "myimageai-v1",
  "prompt": "An original anime city at sunset, cinematic lighting",
  "negative_prompt": "blurry, low quality",
  "width": 512, "height": 512, "steps": 20, "seed": 42, "num_images": 1
}

### Submit and wait (bounded, ~20s): 200 if finished, else 202
POST {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations?wait=true
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "prompt": "a lighthouse in a storm", "width": 512, "height": 512, "steps": 10 }

### Poll status
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations/{{job}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Result (image URLs)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations/{{job}}/result
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### History
GET {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations/history?page=0&page_size=20&status=COMPLETED
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}

### Cancel (QUEUED jobs only)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/images/generations/{{job}}
Authorization: Bearer {{key}}
